# Cheap agent work

- Implement in the smallest path: one service, or `gateway-web` plus Caddy if routing changed.
- Do not launch project subagents for edits under ~3 files. Use `/kotlin-service`, `/frontend`, `/infra`, `/verifier`, or `/reviewer` only when the task spans many files or needs isolated context.
- Never fan out one subagent per microservice unless the user asked for a swarm.
- Do not read `backlog.md` in full. Grep for a story ID (`ARCH-`, `SRV-`, `UI-`, `CAT-`, `CNT-`, `AMD-`, `ING-`, `OPS-`) if needed.
- When you complete a backlog item, set it to `Done` in `backlog.md` in the same change.
- Run `gradle test` only in the changed service directory. Do not rebuild the Compose stack unless the task is about local orchestration. Prefer `./gradlew test` (wrapper 8.10.2).
